# Docker build context exclusions (review P1 #39): the build needs only
# pyproject + src + README/PRODUCT; everything else — VCS history, local
# virtualenvs, secrets, caches, scratch databases, lab artifacts — stays out.
.git
.gitignore
.venv*
venv
env
.env*
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pyright
dist
build
*.egg-info
# local scratch + lab materials never belong in an image
lab
tests
docs
reference
*.md
!README.md
!PRODUCT.md
# local untracked materials (DB dumps, keys, zone files, reports)
*.sqlite
*.dump
*.key
*.pem
*.zone
*.rules
